OL,3,ANHS data breaches a disgrace, health
OL,4,Asecretary says
OL,5,
OL,6,FNHS staff accessing the medical records
OL,7,Fof the Nottingham attacks victims and
OL,8,Fpossible breaches over a man killed by
OL,9,Fa tiger is a "disgrace", the health
OL,10,Fsecretary has said.
OL,12,FSpeaking to the BBC, Yvette Cooper said
OL,13,Fshe expected action to be taken against
OL,14,Fstaff who had breached NHS data and
OL,15,Fprivacy standards.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
